A||||5||nebulous||Fiero flips out and dies after it warms up.||||1||
Z||000000||nebulous||09-25-2001||01:17 PM||||When I turn my 87 GT on it runs just fine for a few minutes until it warms up then its ignition freaks out and it stalls. It wont come on again until it cools back down. At first I thought there was something wrong with the MSD, but It happens with or without it. A few months ago I got a new distrib, could its ICM be the problem/coil overheating??? Any ideas would be appriciated.||||reg||1
Z||000001||isthiswhereiputausername?||09-25-2001||01:22 PM||||does your check engine light ever come on? <BR>have you checked for codes?<P>you might want to unhook your battery to let your computer reset, then if it does it again, check for any new codes..<P>||||reg||1
Z||000002||nebulous||09-25-2001||01:37 PM||||The check engine light does not come on until it stalls. But I'll check for codes anyway just to be sure.||||reg||1
Z||000003||wantav8||09-25-2001||03:16 PM||||My 87 SE did the same thing, it was the Ignition Module, It was only about a month old, replaced with an original GM and it worked great.||||reg||1
Z||000004||nebulous||09-25-2001||05:03 PM||||What do you all think of that ignition module the fiero store has? Not the Accel but the E-tron one? <A HREF="http://www.secureleadercom.com/store/prodinfo_pegasus.asp?number=51052&variation=&aitem=1&mitem=3" TARGET=_blank>http://www.secureleadercom.com/store/prodinfo_pegasus.asp?number=51052&variation=&aitem=1&mitem=3</A> <BR>Is it any better than GM original(or comparible?<p>[This message has been edited by nebulous (edited 09-25-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000005||btoth||09-25-2001||05:04 PM||||Yes. Check your codes... my car has been doing that for two weeks now.  I got a code 33 and just today I realized that my car only went nuts after the temp hit 160.  I replaced my MAP sensor this afternoon with an ACDelco and reset my codes and everything seems to be ok now. My engine light only came on when it was about to die too, and then would go off.<P>Read this for the full story: <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/013667.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/013667.html</A> <P><BR>(If you don't know how to check the error codes do a search.)<p>[This message has been edited by btoth (edited 09-25-2001).]||||reg||3
